<xri version="1.0">
   <description>
      <p>CCDASTRO PixInsight Scripts</p>
      <p>Configurable post-processing workflows for integrated color master images.</p>
   </description>
   <platform os="all" arch="noarch" version="1.9.4:1.9.5">
      <package fileName="CCDASTROWorkflowManager-1.1.36.zip" sha1="f9e14cb96ec445f19cb75fc6fe18d3b69d6ade59" type="script" releaseDate="20261011133510">
         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.36</title>
         <description>
            <p>Optional luminance preparation before LRGB combination.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>One automatic median-matched or configured HistogramTransformation stretch on a copy of linear L.</li>
               <li>Luminance HDR, repeated LocalHistogramEqualization, repeated masked source blends and optional post-blend LHE reviews.</li>
               <li>Blend-source weight and mask inversion controls, fresh previews and retention of accepted passes.</li>
               <li>Adjustable LHE contrast limit and corrected native HDR lightness-mask property.</li>
               <li>Registered, compatibly stretched sources and masks must be prepared separately. Native testing of the new preparation reviews remains pending.</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
</xri>
